	(text "Hub core layer (spec section 3a). The only controller: Pico 2 W on sockets, VSYS from the stack's +5V through D1\n(so the Pico's own micro-USB cannot back-feed the hub rail); the Pico's 3V3 output is the hub's +3V3 logic rail.\nHost USB D+/D- and BOOTSEL reach the Pico through three pogo pins on its underside pads TP2, TP3, TP6.\nJ1 is the frozen 2x25 stack connector to the connector layer; pin map in tools/sch_hub.py STACK.\nPower switch: closed = PWR_SW_A (UVLO output, pack level, microamps) to PWR_SW_B (battery-switch gate); open = gate to GND.\nOn USB the hub is on regardless of the switch. GP0/GP1 (SDA/SCL) and SP1-SP4 go to the expansion header and the stack."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 264.16 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			) (justify left top)
